    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431220/extras/997497a3aafc34351e16f8012ef0b86d.webp?t=1602851366\" /></div><br><br><strong>10mg</strong> is a collection of 10 minute long games.<br><br><strong>SLASHER, Interrupted</strong> is a visual novel, in which you attempt to tell a horror story whilst your friends interrupt with their own ideas. Will you stick to a cohesive plot, or try and please everyone's ideas at once?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431220/extras/d7c9289a79a4ed11ade94a59b9387769.webp?t=1602851366\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7,000 words of lighthearted campfire banter<br></li><li> A branching story with 27 ending combinations<br></li><li> Pet a cat!<br></li><li> Kill multiple characters!<br></li><li> Get roasted for your messy plot choices!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431220/extras/997497a3aafc34351e16f8012ef0b86d.webp?t=1602851366\" /></div><br><br><strong>10mg</strong> is a collection of 10 minute long games.<br><br><strong>SLASHER, Interrupted</strong> is a visual novel, in which you attempt to tell a horror story whilst your friends interrupt with their own ideas. Will you stick to a cohesive plot, or try and please everyone's ideas at once?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431220/extras/d7c9289a79a4ed11ade94a59b9387769.webp?t=1602851366\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7,000 words of lighthearted campfire banter<br></li><li> A branching story with 27 ending combinations<br></li><li> Pet a cat!<br></li><li> Kill multiple characters!<br></li><li> Get roasted for your messy plot choices!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A campfire horror story interrupted by your girlfriends.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cSLASHER, Interrupted was cute, low-stakes, well-executed... You are on a camping trip, around a fire. You\u2019re telling the others a scary story... but each of them is an appalling backseat storyteller.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cThe writing is impeccable, both in the scary story the protagonist is telling, and the voices of her friends. I adore visual novels, and think Slasher, Interrupted would be a good example for a genre newbie to try.\u201d<br>Outstanding \u2013 Human Game Collective<br><br>\u201cA fun little experience that provides an interesting twist on the choose your own adventure genre and also boasts replayability.\u201d<br>Indie Hive<br>",
